  "details": "In the VRC Avatar Descriptor, given that the Eyes are referencing transforms that are outside of the avatar, when the avatar is uploaded and tested in-game, then it behaves abnormally.\nThe most flagrant behavior that is locally testable is that the avatar is not visible at all on mirrors.\n\nReferencing an external transform happens easily when a VRC Avatar Descriptor is copied between avatars (especially when migrating old avatars to Avatars 3.0), so the mistake isn't totally obvious after uploading the avatar.",
